            "copy": "Along with a great price for what we received, we had excellent service and communication.",
            "author": "Michelle S.",
            "product": "french-fitness-ffb-black-8-stack-multi-jungle-gym-new"
          }
        },
        "review_DLthDM": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "review_image": "shopify://shop_images/186913308_96898112_168779.jpg",
            "stars": "5",
            "title": "Does It All Without Taking Up Space",
            "copy": "The machine allows you to do so many exercises in such a small contained space. Putting it together took some time, so be prepared. Everything went together nicely and works as designed. I would recommend if you want a machine with so much versatility and/or are limited on space.",
